 and took the suggestions seriously... after all, who would know better than the locals about where to get good crawfish. I paid less than half the price per pound of what restaurants were charging downtown and had a great time with some spicy seafood. On top of the crawfish, the corn ..."},{"business_id":"H4MrP38d7bseGgMtXcNpdA","review_id":"LDpyNgusqHq_QtbwEsTVQQ","date":"2015-03-19T20:35:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8936840295791626,"text_excerpt":"I am so happy with the new ownership here! Food is consistent and very good! crawfish cleaned well and boiled perfectly. Oyster and shrimp poboys one of the best in the city! 13\" stuffed and not so salty you don't taste the quality of the seafood! Support them folks they're the real deal!!!!!"},{"business_id":"H4MrP38d7bseGgMtXcNpdA","review_id":"5SD-k-hIV3iztI5Hr_GQ2Q","date":"2012-04-20T22:23:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8870842456817627,"text_excerpt":"Spicy and very well-seasoned! We enjoyed several pounds of shrimp and crawfish from Kjean's at a friend's party. The shrimp were HUGE. Everything tasted great - the shrimp, crawfish, corn on the cob, and potatoes were delicious! My friend raved that the order went smoothly and was ready on time."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"H4MrP38d7bseGgMtXcNpdA","photo_id":"qBoTS9A8awVQV7md04kQGg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qBoTS9A8awVQV7md04kQGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8871201276779175},{"business_id":"H4MrP38d7bseGgMtXcNpdA","photo_id":"Ypv3Xj95n_C_ZIJpiDEAGA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ypv3Xj95n_C_ZIJpiDEAGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8871200680732727}]},"notebook_case":null}
